    <sys:String x:Key="LOCCSM_WindowsDeviceSoundTitle">Windows device sounds</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCCSM_WindowsDeviceSoundHelp">Windows already plays Device Connect/Disconnect sounds. If you enable Controller Manager connect/disconnect sounds without turning those Windows sounds off, both will play — the plugin cue is delayed by about 320 ms so they overlap less. Leave the plugin sounds off for a single cue, or disable the Windows device sounds in Sound settings if you only want these packs.</sys:String>
